# Edge cases: very small dictionaries and dense matches

- **1 key**: the new class takes {{FEW_1_TIMES}} times as long as the fastest existing method.
- **4 keys**: {{FEW_4_TIMES}} times as long. `Str\Matcher` and `Str\Replacer` are not meant for dictionaries this small, and the main tables leave them out.
- **Text dense with matches**: the new class is faster in every case, {{DENSE_SPAN}}.

{{LEGEND}}

## Fewer than 8 keys

Texts are 4 KiB of English PHP documentation with one key written in.

{{FEW_TABLE}}

## Texts dense with matches

128 frequent English words (ranks 101–228) on English text, so matches are close together.

{{DENSE_TABLE}}
